Freguesias de Santa Catarina da Serra e Chain\u00e7a. No s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde correm-se as provas competitivas \u2014 <strong>Trail de 32 km<\/strong> (1600m D+), <strong>Trail Sprint de 19 km<\/strong> (850m D+) e <strong>Mini-Trail de 13 km<\/strong> (650m D+) \u2014, ficando a manh\u00e3 de domingo reservada para a <strong>Caminhada guiada de 10 km<\/strong> (300m D+).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>SerranosRun Team \/ Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra<\/strong> e homologado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria (ADAL), o evento inclui t-shirt oficial, lembran\u00e7a <em>finisher<\/em>, entrada no certame gastron\u00f3mico e refei\u00e7\u00e3o completa (sopa, bifana e bebida). Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 2