minhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 300m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se a 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Complexo Desportivo da Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra (Rua da Portela, n\u00ba 21), em Santa Catarina da Serra, concelho de Leiria.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, partem as provas competitivas: Trail 32 km (1600m D+) \u00e0s 15:30, Trail Sprint 19 km (850m D+) \u00e0s 16:15 e Mini-Trail 13 km (650m D+) \u00e0s 16:30. No domingo, 22 de novembro, a Caminhada de 10 km (300m D+) inicia-se \u00e0s 10:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em duas fases (1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 15\/09 e 2\u00aa fase de 16\/09 a 15\/11\/2026): Trail 32 km (20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac), Trail Sprint 19 km (18 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac), Mini-Trail 13 km (16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac) e Caminhada 10 km (12 \u20ac \/ 14 \u20ac). Atletas filiados na ADAL t\u00eam 1 \u20ac de desconto no Trail e Trail Sprint.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt alusiva, lembran\u00e7a finisher, entrada no Festival Gastron\u00f3mico do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra, refei\u00e7\u00e3o (sopa, bifana e bebida), banhos e seguro. Nas tr\u00eas provas de trail \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (1 L nos 32 km; 0,5 L nos 19 km e 13 km), copo, manta t\u00e9rmica, lanterna frontal, apito e telem\u00f3vel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e qual \u00e9 o tempo limite das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo SerranosRun Team \/ Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra, com parecer t\u00e9cnico da ADAL. O tempo limite na meta \u00e9 de 5 horas para o Trail (32 km), 4 horas para o Trail Sprint (19 km) e 3 horas para o Mini-Trail (13 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque Desportivo da Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra, Santa Catarina da Serra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Leiria\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"SerranosRun Team \/ Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se a 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Complexo Desportivo da Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra (Rua da Portela, n\u00ba 21), em Santa Catarina da Serra, concelho de Leiria.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, partem as provas competitivas: Trail 32 km (1600m D+) \u00e0s 15:30, Trail Sprint 19 km (850m D+) \u00e0s 16:15 e Mini-Trail 13 km (650m D+) \u00e0s 16:30. No domingo, 22 de novembro, a Caminhada de 10 km (300m D+) inicia-se \u00e0s 10:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em duas fases (1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 15\/09 e 2\u00aa fase de 16\/09 a 15\/11\/2026): Trail 32 km (20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac), Trail Sprint 19 km (18 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac), Mini-Trail 13 km (16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac) e Caminhada 10 km (12 \u20ac \/ 14 \u20ac). Atletas filiados na ADAL t\u00eam 1 \u20ac de desconto no Trail e Trail Sprint.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt alusiva, lembran\u00e7a finisher, entrada no Festival Gastron\u00f3mico do Ch\u00edcharo da Serra, refei\u00e7\u00e3o (sopa, bifana e bebida), banhos e seguro. Nas tr\u00eas provas de trail \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (1 L nos 32 km; 0,5 L nos 19 km e 13 km), copo, manta t\u00e9rmica, lanterna frontal, apito e telem\u00f3vel.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o evento e qual \u00e9 o tempo limite das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo SerranosRun Team \/ Uni\u00e3o Desportiva da Serra, com parecer t\u00e9cnico da ADAL. O tempo limite na meta \u00e9 de 5 horas para o Trail (32 km), 4 horas para o Trail Sprint (19 km) e 3 horas para o Mini-Trail (13 km).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70177,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[38,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51860","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-leiria","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-leiria","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-do-chicaro-da-serra.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51860","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www